From 83605de2063faa878d254586d22c55a0a10c3125 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:27:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PETSc: options of the solvers shared by the modules

The initialization of PETSc and the options of the solvers of PETSc
(written in the options database with a prefix which is unique to the
solver, the options never read by PETSc being reported, and removed with
the solver) move from the module of the linear solvers of PETSc to
PETScSupport, for the non linear solver of PETSc.
